 Now\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 current\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 file\'92s\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Other\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Specs\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 critical\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 specs\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 matches\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 new suspension, click on File, then Print Blank Worksheet to obtain the worksheet shown in Figure 4.3.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Note that the Print Report menu will flash for about a second or so before the worksheet is printed (see Figure 4.10 to see a worksheet).\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb9\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s8\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\sl240\slmult1\f3\fs32\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Make\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Measurements\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri5305\sl244\slmult1\sb236\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 With\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 blank\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 worksheet\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 you\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 are\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 now\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 ready\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 to\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 make\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 measurements. Check pages 18-21 for some background on these measurements.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri917\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Taking measurements can be a difficult and time consuming task if you try to be \f8\b1\i1 extremely \f0\b0\i0 accurate.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 You have got to keep in the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 back\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 your\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 mind\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 that\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 entire\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 suspension\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 not\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 perfectly\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 rigid.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Bushings\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 compress,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 arms\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 struts\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 bend,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 tire\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 sidewalls deflect.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 In most cases, accuracy within\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 0.1\'94 (one tenth)\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 is usually sufficient.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 It is unrealistic to expect that you can measure things more accurately than this, however professional race teams with the best tools can do better.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb2\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\fi-1\ri917\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 There\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 are\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 tools\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 fixtures\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 available\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 to\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 help\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 measurement\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 process\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 *\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 .\expnd