  \expnd0\expndtw0 Now you want to put only that front suspension on an existing vehicle file which has both a front and rear, but you want to keep the rear.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 You would click on File, then Open, then choose the Selective Open option shown in Figure 6.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 This feature also lets you put a front suspension on the rear or rear suspension on the front (McPhearson Strut or Double A Arm only).\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery725\footery744\margtsxn1100\margbsxn940\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb144\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li948\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20
